{"id": "q0068", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4093614844, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "In a family, there are 2 brothers and 3 sisters. All sisters are the same age, which is 16. One of the brothers is 12 years old, which is half the age of the older brother. What is the total age of all these siblings?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0068.wav", "input_sha256": "ec3173c9c40b131f065591b344ef6b49756d2d167f3d63288d359278d48b5179", "input_samples": 284400, "input_s": 17.775, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.1726, "act": 0.9974, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, there are two brothers. One brother is 1 2 years old, and the other brother is twice that age, so he's 2 4 years old. There are three sisters, each 16 years old. So, adding them up: 12 plus 24 is 3 6 for the brothers, and 16 times 3 is 48 for the sisters. Adding those together, 3 6 plus 4 8 equal s 8 4. So, the total age of all these siblings is 8 4 years.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 18, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 33, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0068_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "7e8594de1cf1c9957c317cd72692bae271b5b70ee720915af0696adb41cf9160", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 33.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.075, 1.138, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.079, 2.142, 1, 