{"id": "q0100", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2864504703, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Let $P(x)$ be a monic polynomial of degree 3.  Suppose that $P(x)$ has remainder $R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 1)(x - 4),$ and remainder $2R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 2)(x - 3).$  Given that $P(0) = 5,$ find $P(5).$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0100.wav", "input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "input_samples": 271400, "input_s": 16.962, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.8784, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Let \\[ p(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+5 \\] since \\(p(x)\\) is monic degree 3 and \\(p(0)=5\\).", "expert_answer": "Let\n\n\\[\np(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+5\n\\]\n\nsince \\(p(x)\\) is monic degree 3 and \\(p(0)=5\\).\n\nIf the remainder is \\(r\\) when divided by \\(x-1\\) and \\(x-4\\), then\n\n\\[\np(1)=r,\\qquad p(4)=r\n\\]\n\nand if the remainder is \\(2r\\) when divided by \\(x-3\\), then\n\n\\[\np(3)=2r.\n\\]\n\nCompute:\n\n\\[\np(1)=1+a+b+5=a+b+6\n\\]\n\n\\[\np(4)=64+16a+4b+5=16a+4b+69\n\\]\n\nSo\n\n\\[\na+b+6=16a+4b+69\n\\]\n\n\\[\n5a+b=-21\n\\]\n\nAlso,\n\n\\[\np(3)=27+9a+3b+5=9a+3b+32\n\\]\n\nand\n\n\\[\np(3)=2p(1)\n\\]\n\nso\n\n\\[\n9a+3b+32=2(a+b+6)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7a+b=-20\n\\]\n\nNow subtract:\n\n\\[\n(7a+b)-(5a+b)=-20-(-21)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2a=1\n\\]\n\n\\[\na=\\frac12\n\\]\n\nThen\n\n\\[\n5\\left(\\frac12\\right)+b=-21\n\\]\n\n\\[\nb=-\\frac{47}{2}\n\\]\n\nNow find \\(p(5)\\):\n\n\\[\np(5)=125+25a+5b+5\n\\]\n\n\\[\np(5)=130+25\\left(\\frac12\\right)+5\\left(-\\frac{47}{2}\\right)\n\\]\n\n\\[\np(5)=130+\\frac{25}{2}-\\frac{235}{2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\np(5)=130-105=25\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{25}\n\\]", "transcript": "Let p x dots be a monic polynomial of degree 3. Suppose that p x has remainder r x when it is divided by x minus 1, x minus 4, and remainder 2r x stars when it is divided by x minus 3. Given that p zero equals 5, find p 5. Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 4.13, "expert_s": 18.33, "expert_input_samples": 271400, "expert_input_s": 16.962, "expert_input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 13823, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 3081, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 32673, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "d618e3305e8a53bcd622ee372066261d23d0de8271e869a85e554289701130ce", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 27.2}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "2c1f243df58254e4e3c9a6d9db7b0cdc20e45c46f0846dd831e05b2523402308", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "3e1a573b476632583287d6f43c057b3d8cccfff43f2d0c78ea67e4bdbce84d7f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 61.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.135, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.135, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.079, 3.141, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.071, 4.129, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.079, 5.143, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.075, 6.136, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.074, 7.136, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.075, 8.135, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.077, 9.14, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.085, 10.15, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.082, 11.141, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.075, 12.137, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.075, 13.13, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.083, 14.144, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.081, 15.141, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.082, 16.146, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 16.962, 17.041, 17.1, 1, 0, 0], [17