{"id": "q0115", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3284998833, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "In the land of Ink, the money system is unique. One Trinket is equal to 4 Blinkets, and 3 Blinkets are equal to 7 Drinkets. In Trinkets, what is the value of 56 Drinkets?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0115.wav", "input_sha256": "425f92be59171877dec281c6414f9619dfde45f63ec7c9755b417a80bd6f497e", "input_samples": 209600, "input_s": 13.1, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.4269, "act": 0.998, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Okay, so let's see if we can figure this out. So one trink et equals four blanket s, and three blanket s equal seven drink its. So if I convert everything to trink its, that might help. Let's start with the blankets. If three blanket s are seven drink its, then one blanket must be seven divided by three drink its. But wait, that doesn't make sense because we're trying to get to tri nkets. Maybe I should flip it around. Since one tri nket is four blanket s, then four blanket s equal one tri nket. Now, if three blankets are seven drinkits, how many tri nkits is that? Well, since one blanket is four tri nkits, three blanket s would be 1 2 trinkits. But hold on, that contradicts the second part. Three blankets equal seven drink its, not twelve tri nkits. I think I mixed up the conversion. Let me try again. One tri nket equals four blanket s, so one blanket is a quarter of a tri nket. Then, three blankets would be three quarters of a tri nket, which equals seven drink its. That still doesn't work. Maybe I should set up an equation. Let T equal tri nkits, B equal blanket s. We", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 13, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 748, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1783, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0115_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "7e8ee9b68a3e32bce9831899f7d5af0abe11b80c8f0a8686caf15303c8d4e814", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.125, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.07, 2.127, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.075, 3.132, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.074, 4.136, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.072, 5.128, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.075, 6.131, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.074, 7.134, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.072, 8.128, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.078, 9.139, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.073, 10.132, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.07, 11.129, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.073, 12.128, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.073, 13.13, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.1, 13.197, 14.848, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.1, 14.929, 15.637, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.1, 15.707, 16.433, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.1, 16.509, 17.235, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.1, 17.319, 18.044, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.1, 18.179, 18.908, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.1, 19.184, 19.923, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.1, 20.18, 20.914, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.1, 21.191, 21.973, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.1, 22.19, 22.976, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.1, 23.19, 23.996, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.1, 24.188, 24.927, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.1, 25.19, 25.923, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.1, 26.184, 26.904, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.1, 27.19, 27.979, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.1, 28.191, 29.007, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.1, 29.193, 29.992, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.1, 30.196, 30.956, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.1, 31.189, 32.051, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.1, 32.188, 33.012, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.1, 33.192, 34.067, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 