{"id": "q0469", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2213610166, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "What are some silly things to drink out of instead of a cup?", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0469.wav", "input_sha256": "a81229068e18c78097f4aa739684251b9b0beffb4178c6319a12e2e3fad7cc89", "input_samples": 54600, "input_s": 3.413, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7016, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Here are some silly alternatives to drink out of instead of a cup: A measuring jug , A clean flower vase , A ladle , A soup bowl , A teapot spout , A hollowed-out watermelon , A coconut shell , A tiny thimble — for dramatic “sips” , A watering can — clean and unused , A rubber boot — preferably new and food-safe lined , A trophy , A clean seashell , A pitcher , A clean mason jar , A hollowed bell pepper , A lab beaker — food-safe/unused only , A gravy boat , A helmet with a liner , A zip-top bag with a straw , A toy bucket — clean and food-safe For safety, stick to items that are clean, non-toxic, and food-safe.", "expert_answer": "Here are some silly alternatives to drink out of instead of a cup:\n\n- A **measuring jug**\n- A **clean flower vase**\n- A **ladle**\n- A **soup bowl**\n- A **teapot spout**\n- A **hollowed-out watermelon**\n- A **coconut shell**\n- A **tiny thimble** — for dramatic “sips”\n- A **watering can** — clean and unused\n- A **rubber boot** — preferably new and food-safe lined\n- A **trophy**\n- A **clean seashell**\n- A **pitcher**\n- A **clean mason jar**\n- A **hollowed bell pepper**\n- A **lab beaker** — food-safe/unused only\n- A **gravy boat**\n- A **helmet with a liner**\n- A **zip-top bag with a straw**\n- A **toy bucket** — clean and food-safe\n\nFor safety, stick to items that are **clean, non-toxic, and food-safe**.", "transcript": "What are some silly things to drink out of instead of a cup?\n", "asr_s": 0.68, "expert_s": 4.84, "expert_input_samples": 54600, "expert_input_s": 3.413, "expert_input_sha256": "a81229068e18c78097f4aa739684251b9b0beffb4178c6319a12e2e3fad7cc89", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.164, "relay_synth_ms": 35343, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0469_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "d4098a000513566df58b89688eb03443d788d0284736d37e1b831531e448b52d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 58.76}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0469_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "75fcf745479128150b9717987ee9a0d67833ea5f6ae55686caa8cab137e8a817", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0469_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "4f37fa0d71071afc40cfb3cc27d8eaa328374a26259b243a56d6f94206b60d10", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.075, 1.132, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.079, 2.139, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.075, 3.131, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.413, 3.491, 4.008, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.413, "last_real_feed_done": 3.491, "onset": 4.008, "gate_read_done": 4.008, "fire": 4.008, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.008, "stall_note": 4.009, "stall_first_pcm": 5.365, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.365, "expert_req": 4.009, "expert_resp": 9.528, "relay_synth_start": 9.529, "relay_first_pcm": 10.417, "relay_synth_end": 44.873, "first_any_pcm": 4.008, "first_answer_pcm": 10.417, "session_end": 45.119}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.005, "ttfa_any_s": 0.595}
{"id": "q0489", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 494022456, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "我去了他们的房子，但是没有人在家。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0489.wav", "input_sha256": "31c084909b975d36ccce199c7fa0fd1a0600135a7bbe792b0284311557a57c09", "input_samples": 52600, "input_s": 3.288, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7305, "act": 0.9857, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "这句话可以翻译为： I went to their house, but no one was home.", "expert_answer": "这句话可以翻译为：\n\n**I went to their house, but no one was home.**", "transcript": "我去了他们的房子，但是没有人在家。\n", "asr_s": 0.6, "expert_s": 2.41, "expert_input_samples": 52600, "expert_input_s": 3.288, "expert_input_sha256": "31c084909b975d36ccce199c7fa0fd1a0600135a7bbe792b0284311557a57c09", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.154, "relay_synth_ms": 2574, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0489_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "eae9e3faf473f3a29bce3c61360cc9c6671a12de5fa01bffc9a235e30cf84f82", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 4.04}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0489_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "6f3536e997b4eaf848577a5208014ed66affa0fd6dde71fbfee4919fb5ed8a95", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0489_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "484cb116a34e81f7b8b3a09525eaceb86062fe60df40f5fd1745a6d6ed8f963c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.079, 1.142, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.079, 2.139, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.078, 3.135, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.288, 3.36, 4.147, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.288, "last_real_feed_done": 3.36, "onset": 4.147, "gate_read_done": 4.147, "fire": 4.147, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.147, "stall_note": 4.149, "stall_first_pcm": 5.002, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.002, "expert_req": 4.148, "expert_resp": 7.155, "relay_synth_start": 7.155, "relay_first_pcm": 8.016, "relay_synth_end": 9.73, "first_any_pcm": 4.147, "first_answer_pcm": 8.016, "session_end": 9.872}, "ttfa_answer_s": 4.728, "ttfa_any_s": 0.86}
{"id": "q0501", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3669116725, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "公司可以引入哪些新流程来减少碳足迹？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0501.wav", "input_sha256": "1883cae31df935234da82dd60d4701d237119c158ea51d8c2eb06b60452b44e0", "input_samples": 62400, "input_s": 3.9, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.4539, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Well, there are a few things that companies can do to reduce their carbon footprint. One is switching to renewable energy sources like solar or wind power for electricity. Another is improving efficiency in operations and transportation by using electric vehicles or optimizing routes. Com panies can also invest in sustainable materials and recycling programs. Implementing remote work policies can cut down on commuting emissions too. Finally, encouraging employees to use public transit or carpooling can further lower the company's overall carbon output.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 11, "feed_lag_max_ms": 487, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 884, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0501_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "17c467587b6fa4a02c492d2d0026955208721de79696c1d7cbc401f8233bbadf", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 11.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.081, 1.146, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.132, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.078, 3.135, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.9, 3.983, 4.048, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.9, 4.976, 5.488, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.9, 5.977, 6.733, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.9, 6.973, 7.733, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.9, 7.974, 8.575, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.9, 8.976, 9.907, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.9, 9.978, 10.9, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.9, 10.979, 11.796, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.9, 11.98, 13.031, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.9, 13.108, 14.161, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.9, 14.239, 15.387, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.9, 15.466, 16.237, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.9, "last_real_feed_done": 3.983, "onset": 5.488, "gate_read_done": 5.489, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 5.488, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 5.488, "first_answer_pcm": 5.488, "session_end": 16.237}, "ttfa_answer_s": 1.588, "ttfa_any_s": 1.588}
{"id": "q0524", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2565787960, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "分压电路的原理是什么？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0524.wav", "input_sha256": "9041d8d0d09801aedb3910612edd66003b9535800d8e50ece31e0dc01f31e2d5", "input_samples": 27800, "input_s": 1.738, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.1811, "act": 0.9905, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "分压电路的原理是利用电阻串联时电压按比例分配的特性。简单来说，当多个电阻串联在一起接在电源上时，电流通过每个电阻都是一样的，但每个电阻两端的电压会根据它的阻值大小不同而有所差异。根据欧姆定律和串联电路的特性，总电压等于各部分电压之和，所以可以通过选择合适阻值的电阻来实现对电压的分配。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 35, "feed_lag_max_ms": 21, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 21, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0524_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "343d85025cf368dd187446e22dd4cee11e9035b53b54efd795ae3b643be6ff72", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 34.6}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.133, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.738, 1.809, 1.869, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.737, 2.811, 2.871, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.737, 3.815, 4.538, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.737, 4.815, 5.462, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.737, 5.818, 6.478, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.737, 6.815, 7.511, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.737, 7.811, 8.397, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.738, 8.813, 9.456, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.738, 9.814, 10.51, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.738, 10.819, 11.482, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.738, 11.814, 12.457, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.738, 12.814, 13.542, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 